    {
      "@id": "exp:cifar10_cifar100_compression",
      "@type": "mls:Experiment",
      "mention": {
        "start_char_doc": 25728,
        "end_char_doc": 25762,
        "prefix": "locks.  ## 4.1 Implementation Details  We train all of our models from scratch. ",
